{
 "title": "Logging \u2014 log ingestion by service (tee -a watch)",
 "description": "Bytes, lines, bytes per line and NUL padding chunks per production service. Built for step 13 of the Logging Improvement programme (Confluence 2774335489): shows whether a tee -a release stopped a service's padding. Source file: bravo-analysis/tools/datadog/log-ingestion-dashboard.json. All metric queries use .as_count() so period sums match daily rollups.",
 "layout_type": "ordered",
 "reflow_type": "fixed",
 "template_variables": [
  {
   "name": "service",
   "prefix": "service",
   "available_values": [
    "prod-ms-audit-trail",
    "prod-ms-lms-ops",
    "prod-ms-cnv",
    "prod-ms-assistance",
    "prod-ms-user-iam",
    "prod-sharia-user-iam-sharia",
    "prod-ms-supplier",
    "prod-ms-repeat-order",
    "prod-agent-marketing",
    "prod-customer-bff",
    "prod-ms-collection-consumer",
    "prod-ms-rule-engine",
    "prod-ms-scheduling",
    "prod-ms-agency",
    "prod-ms-gen-ai",
    "prod-ms-kyc-proxy",
    "prod-ms-integrity",
    "prod-ms-robot-controller",
    "prod-ms-partnership",
    "prod-ms-backoffice",
    "prod-ms-gold-service",
    "prod-ms-unsecured-v2"
   ],
   "default": "*"
  }
 ],
 "widgets": [
  {
   "definition": {
    "type": "note",
    "background_color": "white",
    "font_size": "14",
    "text_align": "left",
    "show_tick": false,
    "has_padding": true,
    "content": "**Log ingestion by service** (Logging Improvement, step 13)\n\nDatadog bills on **bytes ingested**. A real log line weighs 1 to 3 KB. A service whose **bytes per line** is above 10 KB is sending **NUL padding**: its entrypoint pipes through plain `tee`, and the 19:00 UTC truncation leaves a gap of NUL bytes that the Agent re-reads as `...TRUNCATED...` chunks.\n\n- `tee -a` fixed: bytes per line falls to about 2 KB, padding chunks go to 0, **the line count does not change**.\n- Judge a release on the first full UTC day after the next 19:00 UTC run, then over 7 days.\n- Use the `service` variable to pick one service. Source: `datadog.estimated_usage.logs.*`, which is Datadog's own usage estimate. The invoice is the final word.\n\nConfluence: Logging Improvement (page 2774335489).\n\nEvery metric query uses `.as_count()`. Without it, a scalar sum of this usage metric over a day came out up to 2\u00d7 too high for some services (checked 22 October); with it, the sums match the daily `rollup(sum, 86400)` series exactly."
   },
   "layout": {
    "width": 12,
    "height": 2,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   }
  },
  {
   "definition": {
    "type": "query_value",
    "title": "GB ingested, selected period",
    "autoscale": false,
    "precision": 0,
    "requests": [
     {
      "response_format": "scalar",
      "queries": [
       {
        "data_source": "metrics",
        "name": "bytes",
        "query": "sum:datadog.estimated_usage.logs.ingested_bytes{$service}.as_count()",
        "aggregator": "sum"
       }
      ],
      "formulas": [
       {
        "formula": "bytes / 1000000000"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "layout": {
    "width": 3,
    "height": 2,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 2
   }
  },
  {
   "definition": {
    "type": "query_value",
    "title": "Log lines ingested, selected period",
    "autoscale": true,
    "precision": 1,
    "requests": [
     {
      "response_format": "scalar",
      "queries": [
       {
        "data_source": "metrics",
        "name": "lines",
        "query": "sum:datadog.estimated_usage.logs.ingested_events{$service}.as_count()",
        "aggregator": "sum"
       }
      ],
      "formulas": [
       {
        "formula": "lines"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "layout": {
    "width": 3,
    "height": 2,
    "x": 3,
    "y": 2
   }
  },
  {
   "definition": {
    "type": "query_value",
    "title": "Bytes per line (padding if above 10,000)",
    "autoscale": false,
    "precision": 0,
    "requests": [
     {
      "response_format": "scalar",
      "queries": [
       {
        "data_source": "metrics",
        "name": "bytes",
        "query": "sum:datadog.estimated_usage.logs.ingested_bytes{$service}.as_count()",
        "aggregator": "sum"
       },
       {
        "data_source": "metrics",
        "name": "lines",
        "query": "sum:datadog.estimated_usage.logs.ingested_events{$service}.as_count()",
        "aggregator": "sum"
       }
      ],
      "formulas": [
       {
        "formula": "bytes / lines",
        "conditional_formats": [
         {
          "comparator": ">",
          "value": 10000,
          "palette": "white_on_red"
         },
         {
          "comparator": "<=",
          "value": 10000,
          "palette": "white_on_green"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "layout": {
    "width": 3,
    "height": 2,
    "x": 6,
    "y": 2
   }
  },
  {
   "definition": {
    "type": "query_value",
    "title": "NUL padding chunks (...TRUNCATED... lines), selected period",
    "autoscale": true,
    "precision": 0,
    "requests": [
     {
      "response_format": "scalar",
      "queries": [
       {
        "data_source": "logs",
        "name": "padding",
        "search": {
         "query": "\"...TRUNCATED...\" $service"
        },
        "indexes": [
         "*"
        ],
        "compute": {
         "aggregation": "count"
        }
       }
      ],
      "formulas": [
       {
        "formula": "padding",
        "conditional_formats": [
         {
          "comparator": ">",
          "value": 1000,
          "palette": "white_on_red"
         },
         {
          "comparator": "<=",
          "value": 1000,
          "palette": "white_on_green"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "layout": {
    "width": 3,
    "height": 2,
    "x": 9,
    "y": 2
   }
